1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:56,770
These Fire Spirit Beasts are endless !

25
00:01:57,160 --> 00:02:01,610
Our top priority is to activate the Country Sealing Formation.

26
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:05,490
Otherwise, even if we flee to Xuanwu,

27
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,410
the Fire Spirit Beasts will follow us

28
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:10,930
and the country of Xuanwu will also be burned to the ground.

29
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,090
Senior Brother Song is right,

30
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,650
we should act fast.

31
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:21,330
Order the army to cross the border at all costs !

32
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:23,970
After we activate the Country Sealing Formation,

33
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,970
we will invade Xuanwu together !

34
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,770
Hold on ! If we can't cross,

35
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,730
then the Burning Fire Alliance will perish here !

36
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:53,690
What is this ?

37
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:54,810
I have a bad feeling about this.

38
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:56,410
Everyone, be careful !

39
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:05,050
What are they doing ?

40
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:06,830
What is this ?

41
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,450
What the hell is this?

42
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:26,090
Those beasts have... mutated !

43
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:28,490
The Fire Spirit Beasts are growing stronger,

44
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,730
we need to cross now !

45
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:30,570
Charge !

46
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:34,250
Follow me!

47
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:12,050
Let's do this !

48
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:31,010
Big brother !

49
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:42,130
Big...

50
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,970
brother...

51
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,410
Wan'er...

52
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:54,770
No...

53
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:03,810
Brother...

54
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:09,490
Brother !

55
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:30,970
The Fire Spirit Beasts come from here.

56
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:33,730
Sealing this place should restrain these beasts.

57
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:37,010
By using the Country Sealing Formation,

58
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:40,610
we can trap all the Fire Spirit Beasts within the Burning Fire country.

59
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:43,810
Fellow cultivators, let's begin.

60
00:06:07,440 --> 00:06:09,130
Fellow rogue cultivators,

61
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:12,450
we cannot operate this formation without you.

62
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:14,170
We need Nascent Soul cultivators

63
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:16,650
to use their Nascent Soul as fuel for the formation.

64
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:19,810
It's the only way we have to seal the country.

65
00:06:19,960 --> 00:06:21,090
It's alright,

66
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,930
we'll just lose a hundred years of spiritual energy.

67
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:25,170
Since you are offering Spirit Restoration Pills,

68
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:27,650
Then we will do our best for the Burning Fire Alliance !

69
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,850
Fellow cultivators, focus on operating the formation.

70
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,770
My sect

71
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:33,610
will protect your physical bodies.

72
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:35,090
I guarantee you

73
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:37,730
that we will have established ourselves in Xuanwu in 3 months.

74
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:39,170
When we succeed,

75
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:42,690
I will personally come to welcome you all back.

76
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:53,370
The Country Sealing Formation is activating ! Hurry up !

77
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,970
Is this the Country Sealing Formation ?

78
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:09,160
Let's see what they can do now.

79
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,730
If the Fire Beasts are already this powerful,

80
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:12,890
then I wonder how terrifying it would've been

81
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,610
with the Fire Spirit Beast King.

82
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:18,410
Brother Qiqing, fortune favors the brave.

83
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,450
Junior Sister Muwan,

84
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:21,810
we are at the border of Xuanwu,

85
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,810
you must stay focused.

86
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:36,370
Country of Xuanwu

87
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:53,890
Clear Heart Sect Ancestor

88
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:57,010
Ancestor,

89
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:59,570
I heard that the Burning Fire country is in shambles.

90
00:07:59,360 --> 00:08:00,490
Isn't it amusing ?

91
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:03,850
Let's just watch the spectacle.

92
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:05,730
When two tigers fight,

93
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:08,050
we can just reap the benefits.

94
00:08:11,800 --> 00:08:12,970
What's happening ?

95
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:22,690
Fellow cultivators,

96
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,010
what does this mean !?

97
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,930
Clear Heart Sect disciples,

98
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:38,570
follow me to retreat and seek reinforcements !

99
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:39,770
Hurry up !

100
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,770
You can't escape.

101
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,650
You dared to violate the peace between our countries.

102
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:05,170
Xuanwu's 50 major sects won't let that slide !

103
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:10,010
Your Clear Heart Sect also stole that mountain once.

104
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:13,650
It's just changing owners once again today.

105
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:15,330
The Ancestor is dead !

106
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:16,650
Retreat, quickly !

107
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:18,090
Retreat !

108
00:09:36,160 --> 00:09:38,370
Unaware of your limits ?

109
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,170
Break !

110
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:43,690
You can’t defend Heng Yue Mountain.

111
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:46,090
Instead of letting others claim it,

112
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:48,610
give it to my Xuan Dao Sect.

113
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:52,050
Isn't this just the law of the jungle again ?

114
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,370
Listen up.

115
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,930
During the Fire Spirit Beast attack,

116
00:09:55,680 --> 00:09:58,730
the sects of Xuanwu ignored our pleas for help

117
00:09:58,520 --> 00:10:00,210
and watched from the side.

118
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:02,570
They hoped that

119
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:06,410
they would reap benefits from our loss.

120
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,730
We have no choice

121
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:10,890
but to fight for our survival !

122
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,850
For this war,

123
00:10:12,880 --> 00:10:15,050
every cultivator will be given an artifact.

124
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:19,170
Foundation Establishment cultivators will get a Core Formation artifact

125
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:23,050
and Core Formation cultivators will get a Nascent Soul artifact.

126
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:27,210
All the items you steal will be yours.

127
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:30,650
The Alliance won't confiscate anything.

128
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:33,650
Burning Fire Alliance !

129
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,970
I should be able to find a way to escape

130
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:37,850
amidst the chaos of this war.

131
00:10:37,760 --> 00:10:39,290
All the disciples

132
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:40,770
will also be given

133
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:43,210
a jade slip like this one.

134
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:46,770
This jade records your kill count.

135
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:49,890
For every 100 5th layer of Qi Condensation or above kills,

136
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:52,130
you will get 10 mid-quality spirit stones.

137
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:54,890
For every 20 Foundation Establishment kills,

138
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:57,370
you will get 10 bottles of pills.

139
00:10:57,920 --> 00:10:59,090
These are good rules,

140
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:00,930
they're based on your contribution.

141
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:04,280
Watch me slaughter my way through Xuanwu.

142
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:05,330
We'll get hundreds of spirit stones !

143
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:08,610
Conflict never ends in this chaotic world...

144
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:12,970
Who knows if we will ever find true peace.

145
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:13,730
Everyone,

146
00:11:13,520 --> 00:11:15,650
the Luo River Sect has other rewards.

147
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:19,730
Each month, the person with the most kills will get a Heaven Separating Pill.

148
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:22,210
The Luo River Sect is really going all out !

149
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,410
Did I hear correctly ?

150
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:24,730
A Heaven Separating Pill !?

151
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,810
With a Heaven Separating Pill

152
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:29,250
and with the Underworld Ascension Method,

153
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:31,610
I'm 80% confident I can reach Core Formation.

154
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:34,970
After that, I'll be the strongest under Nascent Soul...

155
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:37,410
Alright, the war is about to begin.

156
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:39,250
All Burning Fire Alliance disciples

157
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:41,570
will report to their assigned squad leader.

158
00:11:41,320 --> 00:11:42,370
Understood !

159
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:47,770
Wang Lin, I have the map Lin Tao copied.

160
00:11:47,880 --> 00:11:49,490
I will give you the first piece now.

161
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:52,890
If you kill 50 Foundation Establishment cultivators,

162
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,610
I will give you the second piece.

163
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:56,170
If you can kill

164
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:58,700
150 Foundation Establishment cultivators,

165
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,930
I will give you the last piece.

166
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:05,170
There is no room for negotiation here...

167
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:07,360
It's either kill for rewards

168
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,970
or die on the battlefield.

169
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:12,890
The Ancestor played her cards well.

170
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:30,210
Zhang Zili
Evil Devil Sect disciple
Early stage Core Formation

171
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:28,850
The 10th squad has begun attacking the Spirit Vein

172
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:31,370
so Xuanwu will surely send reinforcements.

173
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:33,410
Our 8th squad's mission

174
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:36,250
is to intercept anyone passing within 500 li.

175
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:38,370
Now spread out.

176
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,650
If you spot anyone,

177
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:40,810
notify me immediately.

178
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:42,250
Yes squad leader !

179
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:46,130
With my Early stage Core Formation cultivation,

180
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:48,610
I should be attacking sects in the 1st squad.

181
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:52,330
This mission is too boring...

182
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,090
Here, Burning Fire Alliance cultivators !

183
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,410
Let's kill them all !

184
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:10,330
Kill them !

185
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,810
The reinforcements have arrived,

186
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:14,370
it's too late for you to leave now !

187
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:18,690
You will die here !

188
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:23,610
You were fated to die by the Fire Spirit Beasts,

189
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:25,530
stop clinging to your life !

190
00:13:30,360 --> 00:13:31,850
Foundation Establishment brat,

191
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:33,570
the moment I get out of this,

192
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:35,330
I will skin you alive

193
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,810
and rip out your heart !

194
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:39,650
It looks like this bloody war is unavoidable.

195
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:05,650
This flying sword is strange. Retreat !

196
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:18,170
Where do you think you're going ?

197
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:33,650
How did this kid kill them ?

198
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:36,530
Even I couldn't have killed 7 of them instantly.

199
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:39,330
But he's just Middle stage Foundation Establishment...

200
00:14:39,160 --> 00:14:40,210
No !

201
00:14:40,200 --> 00:14:42,250
He must be hiding his cultivation.

202
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:45,850
Over 100 cultivators are approaching from behind.

203
00:14:45,600 --> 00:14:47,970
8th squad, retreat to the Spirit Vein !

204
00:14:54,800 --> 00:14:58,210
Above the Spirit Vein
Country of Xuanwu

205
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:30,330
Attack !

206
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:34,970
Kill them !

207
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:36,970
Burning Fire Alliance, charge !

208
00:15:36,760 --> 00:15:38,290
Fight to the death !

209
00:15:38,040 --> 00:15:39,690
Drive them out of Xuanwu !

210
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,290
Come,

211
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:56,530
bring it on !

212
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:08,410
Ancestor, we are suffering heavy losses.

213
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:10,690
Xuan Jia
Shennong Hall disciple
Early stage Core Formation

214
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:14,490
Hong Tian
Shennong Hall Ancestor

215
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:16,850
Even though he's only Foundation Establishment,

216
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:20,330
he uses strange spells and artifacts.

217
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:23,690
Go, kill him.

218
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,050
Understood.

219
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:40,290
Late stage Foundation Establishment ? They can't beat me.

220
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:05,930
Master really is unmatched below Core Formation.

221
00:17:06,640 --> 00:17:10,010
But you still need to be careful when operating solo.

222
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:12,410
What if a Core Formation cultivator appears ?

223
00:17:24,840 --> 00:17:27,010
Xuan Jia, go !

224
00:17:38,360 --> 00:17:40,610
You're just relying on your artifacts.

225
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:42,930
I will put your miserable life to an end !

226
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:51,570
Damn rat ! Do you have any other spell

227
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:53,370
than your Earth Escape Technique !?

228
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:03,530
Invader, I'll take your life !

229
00:18:14,790 --> 00:18:20,680
I've been walking this path for endless years

230
00:18:17,090 --> 00:18:20,680
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

231
00:18:21,070 --> 00:18:26,280
Is it the compass of fate

232
00:18:22,910 --> 00:18:26,280
that wrote this outcome for us ?

233
00:18:26,190 --> 00:18:32,200
The heavens want to erase your existence,

234
00:18:32,070 --> 00:18:37,920
that's the obsession guiding me.

235
00:18:37,950 --> 00:18:43,520
Is this the path to uncover

236
00:18:39,830 --> 00:18:43,520
truths from falsehoods ?

237
00:18:43,550 --> 00:18:49,120
In a world of murk and shadow,

238
00:18:45,450 --> 00:18:49,120
only the flame of truth can light the way.

239
00:18:48,910 --> 00:18:54,840
Look at them all,

240
00:18:51,790 --> 00:18:54,840
being carried by the waves.

241
00:18:55,030 --> 00:18:59,480
Look at them all,

242
00:18:57,190 --> 00:18:59,480
being drowned.

243
00:18:59,310 --> 00:19:02,800
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

244
00:19:02,590 --> 00:19:05,880
I will let the world refine my soul.

245
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:11,440
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

246
00:19:07,450 --> 00:19:11,440
I will fight.

247
00:19:11,190 --> 00:19:14,560
I'll break through the abyss of despair

248
00:19:14,310 --> 00:19:17,600
to finally learn who I really am.

249
00:19:17,350 --> 00:19:22,960
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

250
00:19:19,230 --> 00:19:22,960
I embrace this obsession.

251
00:19:22,710 --> 00:19:25,920
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

252
00:19:25,670 --> 00:19:28,720
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

253
00:19:28,470 --> 00:19:34,200
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

254
00:19:30,510 --> 00:19:34,200
I'll still fight.

255
00:19:34,150 --> 00:19:37,560
It's hard to avoid loneliness

256
00:19:37,310 --> 00:19:40,600
when you are above everyone else.

257
00:19:40,350 --> 00:19:46,280
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

258
00:19:42,670 --> 00:19:46,280
be afraid of a firefly ?
